    seoTitleEn: "Palma Airport to Porto Cristo | Private Transfer Car",
    seoTitleEs: "Aeropuerto de Palma a Porto Cristo | Traslado Privado",
    metaDescriptionEn: "Private transfer from Palma de Mallorca Airport (PMI) to Porto Cristo, home of the Coves del Drach. Fixed prices, flight tracking, door-to-door service.",
