    titleEn: "Private Transfer from Palma Airport to Andratx",
    titleEs: "Traslado Privado desde el Aeropuerto de Palma a Andratx",
    seoTitleEn: "Palma Airport to Andratx | Private Transfer Service",
    seoTitleEs: "Traslado Aeropuerto de Palma a Andratx | Servicio Privado",
    metaDescriptionEn: "Private transfer from Palma de Mallorca Airport (PMI) to Andratx and Port d'Andratx's yachting harbour. Fixed prices, flight tracking, door-to-door.",
